            </note>
            <note corresp="#d121-f2" n="2" xml:id="d121-f2-content">
                <p>A record of the Baldrige-Bendjedid conversation is in telegram 42404 from Paris,
                    December 8. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, Electronic
